# Buzz loopback adapter. state/ and data/ are already ignored wholesale above, so
# these are belt-and-braces: they keep keypair material and signed-event bytes
# uncommittable even if those broad rules are ever narrowed. No keypair material,
# public or private, is ever committed.
state/buzz-replay/
state/buzz-relay-key/
data/buzz-keypair.*
data/.buzz-keypair.rotation-stage
data/buzz-publisher-targets.jsonl
data/buzz-relay-authorities.jsonl
data/buzz-compromised-unverifiable-pairs.jsonl
